{"operations":[{"content":"# Membership summary\n\nMembers may terminate their membership in writing with a notice period of thirty (30) days, counted from the day the written notice is received [[cite:obs-a00f6977c24d91b5069262ad6f513b91517cd75f \"The notice period for members is\nthirty (30) days, counted from the day the written notice is received.\"]].\n\nThe expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense. Expenses above this threshold require written approval by the treasurer before they are incurred [[cite:obs-e24888d987bd9883461bed41aa2918eb10394f7e \"With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per\nsingle expense. Expenses above the threshold need written approval by the treasurer\nbefore they are incurred.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"0268b0bec2307479021852e9fa4468a841c899c151531ca17806e527d658b8f6","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the notice period for members and the expense approval threshold with exact source citations as requested."}